# Named copies of the iPad and iPhone app, for scripts/install-ios.sh.
#
# Copy this file to Config/ios-copies.local (git ignores it) and put your own
# devices and team IDs in. One copy per line, columns separated by spaces:
#
#   copy     the name you give install-ios.sh
#   device   the device's UDID, or its name if the name has no spaces
#            (both from `xcrun devicectl list devices`)
#   team     the team ID to sign with (`scripts/install-ios.sh teams` lists them)
#   icon     normal, or mirrored to tell two copies apart on one device
#   source   any (whatever is checked out, uncommitted changes included), or
#            origin (only a clean checkout of exactly origin/main)
#   groups   names that install several copies at once, comma-separated, or -
#
# Two copies on one device need different teams: the team is part of the
# bundle ID, so each team's build is a separate app.

# copy       device   team        icon      source  groups
ipad         myipad   8XY9ZW7V6U  normal    any     all
phone        myphone  8XY9ZW7V6U  normal    origin  all
phone-test   myphone  AB12CD34EF  mirrored  any     -
